window.products.push({"id":537022,"name":"Grifarny Sisters Gifts from Sister - Sister Birthday Gifts from Sister, Sister Gifts for Women - Mothers Day Christmas Gifts for Big Sister, Little Si","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Jop3bTZ9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Funny Sister Birthday Gifts from Sister: The sister is very happy to receive such a praise gift, also will remember you every time when she sips her coffee from this beautiful tumbler. Women Gifts for Any Occasion: This sister cup gift is a perfect choice for sisters, women, and females, also as a Christmas, happy birthday, mother's day, Valentine's day, and thank you gifts for sisters. A Complete Tumbler Gift Set: This double wall insulation tumbler can keep your drinks cold or hot for a long time, it is great for coffee, wine, beer, soda, cola, juice, and more. The package also includes 2 stainless steel straws(straight straw + curved straw), 1 tumbler sliding lid, 1 keychain a cleaning brush, and a unique gift box. Premium Material & Double Wall Vacuum Insulated: Hand wash recommended. Made only from the highest quality premium 304 18/8 food-grade stainless steel, highly resistant to rust and break, and easy to clean by hand. The design of walled exterior with a vacuum sealed area between the walls, which can help maintain your drinks temperature for a long time and protects your hands against the temperature. Backed By Our 100% Love It Promises: We expect the recipients of our stainless steel tumblers to absolutely love them. If for any reason you don't love it, please contact us and we'll make it right.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Jop3bTZ9L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Grifarny","source_asin":"B0B12N8D6W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-537022","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B12N8D6W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B12N8D6W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":537023,"name":"DIMPLEX DFP6817E Media-Console Electric Fireplace, Espresso","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71aT4xixmzL._AC_SL1244_.jpg","description":"For instant warmth plus ambiance, this beautifully designed electric fireplace features patented flame technology for the 3D effect of a realistic-looking fire, complete with dancing flames, but without the hassle of cut wood, an open flame, propane, or fumes. The unit does not require venting or a chimney, and no combustion means no greenhouse gasses--just plug it in to any standard household outlet and turn it on for economically heating a living room, bedroom, or other cozy place in the home (uses 90-percent less energy than gas fireplaces to produce visual flames). The unit's fan-forced heater quickly and quietly distributes up to 5,115 BTUs of soothing warmth, while its adjustable thermostat allows for maintaining personal comfort levels. The fireplace can also provide a glowing fire without the heat for visual enjoyment year-round. Concealed controls offer a clean look and a remote control comes included for turning the unit on or off from anywhere in the room. In addition to its fire effect, the elegant fireplace comes equipped with a sturdy mantel that can hold a flat-screen television up to 52 inches. Below the mantel, it provides a full-width cabinet with a glass-paneled front that lifts up for quick access to audio-visual equipment like a DVD player or stereo system, as well as movies, CDs, and more. Finally, two vertical doors, one flanking each side of the fire box, open to reveal a shelved storage cabinet with space for stashing board games, books, a blanket, and other personal items. Best of all, the storage compartments offer a tidy and practical cord-management system that keeps unsightly power cords hidden from view. With its dark espresso finish and traditional style that will nicely accommodate any decor, the 1500-watt electric fireplace measures 20-1/4 by 54-3/4 by 44-3/4 inches.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71aT4xixmzL._AC_SL1244_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DIMPLEX","source_asin":"B002HMCFE8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-537023","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B002HMCFE8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B002HMCFE8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
