window.products.push({"id":537035,"name":"RADIANCE 2208852E Cordless Roman Shade Driftwood, 29\" W X 64\" L","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.7,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/911Khi2s7nL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Relax the look of any room with the calm and comforting Cordless Espresso and Driftwood Flatweave Roman Shades. Environment friendly, private, textured natural shades (also called bamboo blinds, bamboo shades, or woven woods) stylishly reduce bright light and protect your furniture from fading. The rich wood tomes of natural shades are complimentary to trending rugs as well as many hardwood floors and furniture finished. Natural shades are textured window blinds that are available in many different colors and styles. They are popular window treatments for coastal and beach properties, lakeside or country cottages, and traditional or metropolitan homes. These new Roman Shades have no cords, so they are completely safe and pose no risk to small children, a safe and stylish way to decorate your home! Certified as Best for Kids, a window covering program created by an independent lab that includes only cordless shades that are safe for kids. Natural color brings warm tones to your space Inside/Outside Window Mount 5\" Valance Available in 64\" Drops Privacy Includes Mounting Hardwared: left and right brackets, wall anchors, and installation screws Easy to Use Cordless Operation Pull down on the bottom rail (in the center) to lower the shade Push up on the bottom rail (in the center) to raise the shade Tension Spring keep the shade locked in place when no pressure is applied Tension Spring is adjusted to each size of shade, heavier shades require more tension HOME DECOR: Easy to match with a variety of styles, including traditional, casual and contemporary. Recommended Rooms- Living room, bedroom, kitchen, office, den, nursery, kids room, library, basement. INSTALLATION: All hardware and instructions included. DESIGNER TIP: Add additional depth and texture to a room by layering natural shades under curtain panels or cornice boards. To make a window look larger, outside mount the shades on the window molding, or up to the ceiling","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/911Khi2s7nL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"RADIANCE","source_asin":"B072M3MRCN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-537035","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B072M3MRCN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B072M3MRCN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
