window.products.push({"id":537047,"name":"Chateau Home Collection 100% Egyptian Cotton 2-Piece Standard Pillowcase Cover Set 500 Thread Count Damask Stripe Sateen Weave Hotel Premium Soft Comf","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/419AQ8EtrWL._AC_.jpg","description":"LUXURIOUSLY THICK AND BREATHABLE HOTEL BEDDING COLLECTION SHEETS. These exquisite sheets are thick & heavy and have that luxurious hotel feel that only comes with the high thread count fabric crafted from the finest 100% Egyptian cotton yarns. The sheets are closely woven, keeping your comfort in mind and gets softer with each wash. OUR USP -100% Cotton Sheets. We specialize in manufacturing the softest and most luxurious cotton sheets in the industry including our best seller Egyptian sheets HIGHEST QUALITY BEST COTTON SHEETS New & Improved Version: If you love the feel of luxurious hotel sheets & crisp pillowcases, you'll adore our 500 thread count Egyptian Cotton Damask Stripe sheets. The shiny lustrous look along with the elaborate Damask Stripe has been meticulously designed to meet your expectations and make any bedroom warm and inviting.Our sheets get softer with each wash, lifetime softness, resist fading, and they are incredibly eco-friendly. FINER AND PREMIER QUALITY YARNS: Our 500 thread count 100% Egyptian cotton pillowcases set are woven with superfine yarn resulting in a lighter and less bulky pillowcases, which are much more breathable and softer unlike the same thread count Set of Pillowcases woven with coarser yarns which are bulkier. A genuine 500 thread count Set of Pillowcase crafted from the softest and Finest Egyptian cotton yarn. Set includes 2 Standard Pillowcases with dimensions 20\"x 30\" each. BEST QUALITY CERTIFIED STANDARD 100 BY OEKO-TEX - Your new 500 thread count sheets are tested thoroughly to ensure the utmost safety and comfort. Every inch of our fabric meets top performance standards for shrinkage, color fastness, strength, and thread count. Extensive product inspection checks and ongoing factory audits ensure sustainability. Each piece of fabric is measured individually and each linen is stitched to perfection. We inspect each piece individually to ensure it is flawless. BETTER EXPERIENCE - Our products are backed by incredible customer service. We are dedicated to ensuring you have an excellent experience, from the moment you place your order until you sleep on your new bedding the first time. ORDER NOW, risk-free. Our designs match any décor and are a wonderful gift idea for men and women, Moms and Dads, Valentine's, Mother's Day, Father's Day, and Christmas. Refresh any room simply, from a kids room to the master suite of your vacation home.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/419AQ8EtrWL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CHATEAU HOME COLLECTION","source_asin":"B07JQ5TJSZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-537047","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07JQ5TJSZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07JQ5TJSZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
