window.products.push({"id":537173,"name":"GEEMBI Quilt Bedding Set-Native American Quilt Bed Set THH2589QS, Queen Size Coverlet for All Season-Soft Microfiber Bedspread+Pillows-Quilts Gifts (K","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":95.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+HagADPlL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"[ 2 IN 1 UNIQUE QUILTS ] Take a look at the design first, your mind will be blown away by the artworks created by our fantastic artists. Every nice piece of work not only a colorful and unique imagine but behind them are stories, themes in life as well as the passion,religious , inspirational and love in each of us. Beyond the drap, duvets and comforters, here are 2 in 1 GEEMBI ARTWORK QUILT. Gifts for Men and Women; Mom and Dad, Valentine's, Mother's and Father's Day; Christmas and New Year. [SELECTION MATERIAL] With two 100% microfiber polyester cotton fabric layers and a fluffy down alternative one in the middle, all these key factors make the blanket SUPER SOFT AND LIGHTWEIGHT, VERY COMFORTABLE for a good night?s sleep, and bring the great slick, silky feel. In additions, the breathable microfiber layers balance the temperature so that the blanket is COOL, NOT TOO HOT when the weather is boiling hot and WARM ENOUGH in the winter. Both functional and decorative [ALL SEASON QUILTS] Unlike duvets and comforters, quilts can be lightweight enough to keep you comfortable in the summer , while remaining on your bed over blankets in the wintertime .This versatility is what keeps quilt enthusiasts coming back. As a part of bedding set or wrap you in while reading a book or just relaxing , enjoy family happy hours while watching favorite TV shows - Perfect for indoor and outdoor use to provide warmth in all seasons, especially for camping and picnic [ DURABLE & EASY-CARE ] Tight stitching or seams on the edging will hold up through washing and won't unravel for longer years to use - Lightweight, durable bedspread sets are perfect for family with pets or kids. .IT'S MACHINE WASHABLE! Simple care for washing microfiber quilted blanket: Wash separately in cold water and then either let them air dry without heat. Microfiber dries quickly and it will fluffier than before. Note: It's better wash microfiber quilts blankets in a mesh laundry bag. [CUSTOMER SERVICE 24/7] 3 sizes are available according to your needs: TWIN: 60x70 inches |QUEEN: 70x80 inches | KING: 91x102 inches + 2 Pillows Perfectly fits the full sized bed and works great for king sized bed while other quilt blankets are just too small. In Business since 1989 - Our Brand is GEEMBI Décor Art and Also guarantees to provide 1-Month return and replacement service & life-time customer service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+HagADPlL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GEEMBI","source_asin":"B0BLJJYMMG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-537173","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BLJJYMMG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BLJJYMMG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
