window.products.push({"id":537213,"name":"HABITAAS Spun Bamboo Coasters for Drinks - Coaster Set with Bamboo Wood Coasters and Coaster Holder. Modern Coasters for Coffee Table (Black)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wL8WRpehL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Add the warmth of handmade, natural materials to your home while keeping a modern, sleek look and feel with this spun bamboo coaster set. Each set includes 6 coasters with holder.Keep your commitment to using sustainable materials in your home with these drink coasters for coffee table. Bamboo is one of the most sustainable materials on the planet; it grows extremely fast, requires minimal watering, and no pesticides.Our boho coasters for drinks feature a sleek lacquered side and a delightfully smooth painted side. Choose from blue, white, gray, sage, or black coasters with matching coaster holder. Use these bamboo drink coasters instead of wood coasters for wooden table to protect your wooden table. These smart, ultra lightweight coasters are a perfect compliment to your decor and make perfect housewarming gifts new home.90 Day Satisfaction Money Back GuaranteeSPECIFICATIONS: 3.75” Diameter x 0.25\" Thick (Coaster); 4.25\" Diameter” x Height 1.75\" (Holder)CARE INSTRUCTIONS: Wipe clean with a damp cloth. Spun bamboo coasters are not dishwasher or microwave safe.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71wL8WRpehL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HABITAAS","source_asin":"B0BY9FG46D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-537213","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BY9FG46D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BY9FG46D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
