window.products.push({"id":537219,"name":"Label Ledge - The Precision Label Applicator/Labeler Machine for Wine Bottles, Beer Bottles, Beer Cans, Candles, Jelly Jars, Jam Jars, Shampoo Bottles","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":74.8,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61cFkNCQViL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Putting labels on any straight-sided or slightly tapered, rounded bottle or jar may seem easy. But getting it straight & done in a jiffy could be problematic, particularly if you’re just ‘eye-balling’ it. To resolve this dilemma, use Label Ledge. For Products That Look Polished & ProfessionalAttach square/rectangular labels with this all-in-1 applicator. Originally created for home vintners & brewers, it makes labeling any round bottle, vessel, or jar easy. The Label Ledge works with a wide range of label sizes from 0.5 to 5 inches without the need to buy costly adapters. Using it allows you to get it straight the first time, so you can label containers quickly. Premium Labeling ExperienceThis label applicator works on rounded vessels with straight or slightly tapered sides. Rust-proof & ideal for wet-labeling, it’s not the same as a label printer for labeling, bottle filler machine, or a cable labeler. Its functionality makes it indispensable to makers of jellies, jams, preserves, candles, drinks, health/beauty products, & more. How to Use Insert the shelf onto the backplate based on the vessel’s diameter size. Place the vessel on the shelf with the bottom seated on the stop plate. Loosen the thumbscrew & slide the ledge to desired position. Then, tighten them to secure the vessel. Place the label on the ledge with 1 edge resting against the ledge’s 90-degree angle while the other hangs over the vessel. Attach the label. Then, lift the vessel off the shelf, & smooth the label. Specifications Weighs 5 lbs. Folded: 2.5 inches Unfolded: 9.5 x 7 x 6.75 inches Sturdy steel construction Mount-to-work-surface feature No-slip rubber feet Dishwasher-safe Commercial-grade finish Made in the USA For a fuss-free labeling experience, trust only the Label Ledge!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61cFkNCQViL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Label Ledge","source_asin":"B08VGMS285","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-537219","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08VGMS285","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08VGMS285","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":537220,"name":"Boston International IHR 3-Ply Paper Napkins, 20-Count Cocktail Size, Dario Dark Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.46,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rsCqzYTPL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"20-Count paper cocktail napkins measure 5 x 5-inches. Napkins are offered in multiple sizes, allowing you to mix and match, layer and customize. Ideal Home Range offers a sustainable option for conscientious consumers, producing 100% biodegradable napkins using the safest tissues, inks and printing processes. We have been sharing our joy in tableware with you since 1977 as the market leader for napkins and table decorations. IHR–three letters that are associated with a passion for tableware all over the world. With us, every day is a celebration—there’s paper napkins, and then there’s IHR.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71rsCqzYTPL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Boston International","source_asin":"B09MDPMN2V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-537220","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09MDPMN2V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09MDPMN2V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
