window.products.push({"id":537309,"name":"eYQM [Newest Design] Ocean Wave Projector,12 LED &7 Colors Night Light,Remote Control,Kids Bedoom,Built-in Mini Music Player(Pearl White)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51XZO8lhheL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Color:Pearl White Have no time for a seaside trip? Do not know how to relax your spare time? Do not know how to make a romantic atmosphere for your lover? Have no idea for how to spend the birthday, anniversary and other important times? Why not choose this light? This ocean wave night light projector with a mini speaker and you enjoy the tranquility or relax after a day's work. It is also perfect for creating a watery ocean atmosphere, which can be used in bathrooms, living rooms, or any other area. It would make a nice backdrop for a trade show booth or office reception area to greet your visitors. Operation Need to Know: ◆1. Toggle the power supply switch to \"ON\" at the bottom of ocean night light, and then  long press the switch key 3 seconds to turn on the light mode 1 light, while lullaby music 1 play. ◆2. Short press the switch key to replace the light mode. ◆3. If you only need to replace the hypnotic song, press the remote control or host to replace the Previous or Next song. ◆4. When inserting the TF card or external source, the lullaby automatically shut down. ◆5. When inserting the external sources, the host and remote control Previous or Next song can be operated. ◆6. According to the remote control H1 / H2 / H4 that the host timer settings, in 1 hour / 2 hours / 4 hours after the automatic shutdown. ◆7. Press the remote control TIMER OFF button to cancel the timer function. ◆8. Long press the key to turn off. Package Content: 1 x Ocean Wave Night Light Projector 1 x USB Cable 1 x Remote Controller (2*AAA batteries not included) 1 x 0.13in audio cable 1 x User Manual 1 x AC adapter(5V 1A)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51XZO8lhheL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"eYQM","source_asin":"B0763JXK6L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-537309","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0763JXK6L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0763JXK6L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
