window.products.push({"id":537346,"name":"ME MOTHER EARTH – Bathroom Shower Mat Non-Slip | Fast Dry Diatomaceous Earth Floor Bath Mat | Super Absorbent | Eco Friendly | All Natural | Easy to C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qAbqcsxqL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","description":"- PLASTIC-FREE: Looking for a sustainable and plastic-free bath mat? Our diatomaceous bathroom mat is completely biodegradable, anti-slip, stylish, and it's quick-dry making it perfect for damp areas. Eliminate synthetic fiber and plastic bathroom mats from polluting our planet with this sustainable swap. - ANTI-SLIP: You will love this all natural, non-slip bathroom shower mat. Our eco-friendly diatomaceous bath mat is great for families, seniors, and even pet owners. They provide better slip resistance than other anti-slip materials while also being easy to clean and maintain. - SUPER QUICK-DRY: Our bath mats are made from diatomaceous clay; a completely renewable and natural resource. These quick drying stone mats can absorb 150% of its weight in moisture, dry in a matter of seconds. Experience the fast-drying properties of diatomaceous earth – the same substance used in swimming pool filters. - MULTIPURPOSE: Our premium bath mat is perfect not just to get out of the shower, but also as a dish rack, hot tub mat, pool mat, under pet bowls (Highly Recommended), by the kitchen sink, and more! - PREMIUM QUALITY: Start your day with a firm footing, and you'll be more likely to complete your morning routine. Our Diatomaceous Earth Bathroom Mats are the ultimate in shower luxury. You will soon see why our eco-friendly bath mat is a quality and sustainable choice that you can feel good about making. Come in a Packaging plastic-Free","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qAbqcsxqL._AC_SL1080_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ME MOTHER EARTH","source_asin":"B09Y1FLF8R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-537346","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Y1FLF8R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Y1FLF8R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":537347,"name":"CASANIER Acacia Wood Cutting Board - 1.5” Thick Extra Large Butcher Block, Reversible Chopping Board with Juice Groove and Handle - Serving Tray for C","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":59.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81TAErWLQoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Bigger The Better - At 18x14x1.5\", this wooden cutting board has an extra large surface making it easy for you to chop, slice, and dice big cuts of meat, fruits, and veggies. It’s your ideal prepping board. Also includes 2 bench scrapers to enhance your prepping experience. Use it as a tool to cut and divide dough, scoop up veggies from board-to-skillet with ease, or use it to make cleaning up easy by scraping off stuck-on bits. Quality - Our heavy duty end grain Acacia wood butcher block is built to last. It is durable yet gentle on your knives. Our board was thoughtfully designed for professional chefs and kitchen novices alike. Acacia wood is the preferred wood for a maximum kitchen performance. Our board comes individually pre-seasoned by hand in premium food grade wood wax oil. Modern Elegance - Looking for a trendy yet timeless statement piece for your space? Our butcher block cutting board comes in a stunning checkerboard design, each one unique, that will certainly give the aesthetic appeal your kitchen or dining room needs. Unlike other standard butcher block cutting boards, this one will surely captivate attention! Less Mess, Less Stress - Keep your kitchen counters clean! Our acacia chopping block comes with a deep juice groove to catch excess liquids when you slice meats, fruits, and veggies. Serve with Style - Flip it over and this extra large cutting board can be used as a charcuterie board for wine and cheese night or as a serving board for canapes, tapas, and appetizers! We highly encourage loving and utilizing both sides of the board. Premium Culinary Gift - Surprise your friends and family with this multifunctional acacia wood cutting board! The luxurious packaging makes it instantly giftable and perfect for any special occasion.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81TAErWLQoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Casanier","source_asin":"B09W95D33V","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-537347","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09W95D33V","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09W95D33V","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
