window.products.push({"id":537369,"name":"Barefoot Dreams CozyChic Palm Leaf Pillow Cover with Insert, Home Decor Decorative Throw Pillows, Retro Decorations for Couch and Bed, Stone Multi, 30","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Nh02ta4XL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Looking for retro or classic looks that would fit perfectly in your bedroom or living room? How about a comfy pillow that is made of a strong a material and can be cleaned no problem? Our beloved CozyChic Palm Leaf Blanket is now available as pillows! This pattern gives a nod to Old Hollywood, inspired by the retro glamour of Los Angeles. Available in two neutrals to match any home décor. Our Palm Leaf pillow is a made from 100% polyester which is a durable material that is smooth to the touch and also easy to clean. Whether it’s for looks, used for naps, or even thrown in the occasional pillow fight, we believe that this pillow is a perfect addition to any furniture ensemble. Our old Hollywood Palm Leaf pattern pillows are classic and timeless and are available in stone-multi or ocean-multi. These pillows are perfect for large or small couches, chairs, loveseats, and even beach swings. We guarantee that our pillows are not only comfortable for lounging but make the perfect neck rest for a quick snooze or a long nap in between activities. Our pillows harken back to simpler time when everyone worked with their hands and every single person who entered your home was treated like a valued guest. Barefoot Dreams is here for all those and many more cases of nostalgia! Whether you are looking to improve the look of your bedroom or spice of the decor of your living room, we’ve got you covered. Become an expert at decorating adding these rustic yet fashionable indoor designs. At Barefoot Dreams, we believe in the combination quality and comfort to provide you with best furniture on the market today.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Nh02ta4XL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Barefoot Dreams","source_asin":"B08SJGMPM2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-537369","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08SJGMPM2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08SJGMPM2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
