window.products.push({"id":537435,"name":"Chef'n Switchit Long Spatula, Clear","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/215K54YKCXL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description The cooking world is flipping over Switchit. On one end, it's great for broad, sweeping strokes. On the other end, it allows a bit more control and finesse. Either end, the ingenious asymmetric design reaches any angle in any pot, pan or bowl. Amazon.com Chef'n Switchit silicone spatulas work twice as hard as conventional spatulas. They are dual-ended, with a working scraper blade on each extreme. Two spatulas in one make them doubly efficient. The 18/10 steel core grip handle, decorated with an artistic swirl design, can be seen through the clear, translucent silicone. The visual effect is very modern, almost futuristic. The Switchit spatula's flexible, resilient silicone is stain- and heat-resistant and can withstand heat of up to 500 degrees F. This level of heat resistance combined with silicone's softness means that the Switchit spatulas can be used with nonstick cookware without fear of scratching the finish. Spatula blades are shaped with an asymmetrical slant to help them hug the curves of pans or bowls while scraping them clean. All of Chef'n's Switchit spatulas are dishwasher-safe. Switchit spatulas are available in small, large, long, and spoon sizes. They also come in clear, red, blue, yellow-green, and peach. This long spatula measures 11-1/2 inches long with two work ends measuring 2-1/4 and 1-1/4 inches wide. --Garland Withers","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/215K54YKCXL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Chef'n","source_asin":"B0002JETA6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-537435","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0002JETA6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0002JETA6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
