window.products.push({"id":537449,"name":"Tefal E3069034 Shallow pan, 30cm, Jamie Oliver, Stainless Steel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":142.2,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-tBXQt0sL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Take cooking to the next level with the new Jamie Oliver by Tefal Cook’s Classics range. Expertly crafted from stainless steel, this premium cookware is designed for a lifetime of professional-style home cooking. The stainless steel is resistant to corrosion, stains and shocks, easy to clean by hand or in the dishwasher, and is guaranteed for 10 years, ensuring lasting performance in the kitchen. On top, we’ve added our superior non-stick coating infused with titanium for enhanced durability (excludes stewpot and saucepans), easy clean-up, and extreme scratch resistance – even when using metal utensils. For peace of mind, the coating is completely toxin-free. We’ve made these pans 10mm deeper† to suit a broader range of culinary uses, and added internal measurements to saucepans and stewpots, so you can gauge quantities inside. Close-fitting, stainless-steel lids on saucepans to help retain moisture and nutrients. Plus, they’re flat for easy storage. And riveted stainless-steel handles with silicone inserts provide a secure grip and more comfortable cooking experience. To really up your cooking game, the non-stick coating pans (excluding stewpot and saucepans) feature our new Thermo-Signal technology: when the hourglass disappears, the pan is at the optimal cooking temperature. And with extra-thick Thermo-Fusion+ bases, this cookware heats quickly and evenly on all hobs, even induction. For added versatility, you can use this range in the oven‡. Better still, it’s dishwasher-safe§. Did we also mention it’s guaranteed for 10 years? Happy days! Designed by Jamie Oliver : “This pot is the one I couldn’t do without. It’s so versatile – it’s my absolute favourite. I use it for everything, from curries and ragùs on the hob to slow-cooked lamb shanks or a tasty chicken stew in the oven.”","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71-tBXQt0sL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tefal","source_asin":"B097R8MW16","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-537449","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B097R8MW16","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B097R8MW16","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
