window.products.push({"id":537476,"name":"Erbulus Turkish Coffee Pot - Briki Greek, Arabic, Fortune Edition Turkish Coffee Maker with Wooden Handle (18 OZ)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":31.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81z+7kcesxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Style: Hammered thick Turkish coffee pot large with different handmade motifs. Turkish coffee, Greek coffee and Arabic coffee is vey similar. It is known as ibrik or cezve in the Turkish culture and widely used in Arab culture as Arabic coffee pot and in Greek culture is called a briki. Size: Height 3.7’’ (9cm). Diameter at base 4.5’’ (11cm). Diameter at top 3.1’’ (8cm). Handle: 7.4’’ (19cm). Capacity 18 oz (530ml), 6 persons. A wooden spoon is included as a gift. Made in Turkey by master craftsmen of Turkish handicrafts in copper works. Inside is coated with a non-reactive food safe tin layer. Turkish Fortune Reading App: This is an application specialized in fortune telling that develops content created by real fortune tellers. It combines the coffee cup photos you send them with the information you have shared with them to present customized readings special for you. Traditional Turkish Coffee Maker: Copper coffee pot is the most preferred coffee pot type for Turkish and Greek coffee. Copper coffee maker helps to maintain the aroma of coffee with its high thermal conductivity. You can use our free recipe prepared for our customers included in our products. Use: You can use in ceramic, electric and gas cookers. Practical mouth helps to dropp liquids easily. Since this is a handmade product, do not put in dishwasher. You can also use this coffee pot for cooking other drinks such as milk and hot chocolate.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81z+7kcesxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Erbulus","source_asin":"B09Z8HN8N9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-537476","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Z8HN8N9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Z8HN8N9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
