window.products.push({"id":537532,"name":"MELOPHY Portable Neck Fan, 5 Speeds Personal Neck Fans for Women Men, 720° Up&Down Airflow Bladeless Rechargeable USB Fan, LED Display, Wearable Hand ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71B3kJ+hjGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🍃Up & Down Air Outlets - Break the tradition, exclusive design! This hanging fan that blows cold air up and down, the 720° surround air volume is 90% higher than other portable fans on the market. Rapid cooling from neck to face and back in 1 second. 🧊Wider Choice of 5 Speeds - We specially designed this foldable neck fan with 5 speeds in this summer! Whether you are working, studying, doing housework, or doing outdoor sports, 5 speed settings can meet all your needs and make every inch of the skin feel refreshed. ✨Newly Added LED Display - Clear at a glance! The electroplated LED display of personal fans for your neck can read the wind speed and battery capacity easier and it is also convenient for you to charge in time. One-button operation is very convenient, press and switch speed wind. 🍃 Quieter & More Durable - Don't let the noise bother you! Unlike other battery powered fan with brushed motors, we adopter an industry-leading brushless motor that is 40% less noisy and lasts 80% longer! Universal USB rechargeable mode, 3 hours fast charging and 6-15 hours working time (depending on speed). ✨Bladeless Neck Fan - This turbo bladeless fan won't stuck hair even if you're near the vent. The travel fan is made of soft skin-friendly material, which is completely non-stick when you sweat. The stylish U-shaped design fits the neck perfectly, the width can be adjusted at will, not easy to break. 💙Say No to Summer Heat - This outdoor fan is lightweight and suitable for men, women. Just hang it around your neck to dissipate your stuffy heat without burdening your neck at all, perfect for outdoor and indoor use. Such as cooking, driving, hiking, traveling, office, gym, cycling, camping, fishing, etc...","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71B3kJ+hjGL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MELOPHY","source_asin":"B0BX8Q3RL6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-537532","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BX8Q3RL6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BX8Q3RL6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
