window.products.push({"id":537586,"name":"Old Farm House by Lois Bryan, 18x24-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":52.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81KCWiNm3tL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features an old white farm house. Lois Bryan describes herself as a 10-year old little kid, cleverly disguised as a 'woman of a certain age'..ordinary, garden-variety, happily married photography Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that Giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of Giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81KCWiNm3tL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B00BKH755K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-537586","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00BKH755K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00BKH755K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":537587,"name":"Kenuket Bento Box Lunch Box, Adult Lunch Container with 3L Large Capacity, Microwave Safe 3 Layers Stackable Lunch Box, Leakproof Food Container with ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61BGjCCe6sL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Premium Material & 3L Large Capacity】Our bento boxes are made of food-grade PP material which is BPA-free and non-toxic, high-quality safe for use. Great size with 3 layers, total 3000ml(101oz) for packing enough healthy food for adults and kids, not overly stuffed again. Suitable for family use, adults to work, kids to school, etc. 【Multiple Layers Combinations】The bento box is stackable and can be freely combined as 1 or 2 or 3 layers use for different amounts of food. For a simple healthy meal, a single layer of 1000ml(33oz) is also sufficient and is lightweight and easy to carry. Each layer is separated by a sealer lid to better lock in freshness and preserve the original taste. Container-inside dimension for each layer: 7.28L x 4.45W x 1.97H inch (18.5L x 11.3W x 5H cm). 【Microwave & Dishwasher & Freezer Safe】The lunch boxes are microwave safe to reheat food(without cover, 2-4 mins under 212℉). The boxes are easy to clean by hand or dishwasher (without cover so no scratches). Also, the boxes are freezer safe to keep food fresh(≧-4℉). All practical designs are for families' more convenient use. 【Leak-proof Design & Durable Buckles】Each layer has a sealed lid and a special design groove for better sealing. The durable buckles on both sides can effectively prevent the leakage of liquids and food. No worry about the lunch overflowing or the lunch box splitting in your lunch bag causing all mess. 【All For Your Needs】We provide two removable dividers and two sauce boxes to diversify your meal for a good appetite. The stylish portable lunch boxes are perfectly designed for packing healthy lunches for adults, teenagers, and children. Suitable for Age: Over 7 years old. Package Includes: 3-layer bento box x 1, fork x 1, spoon x 1, chopsticks x 1, dividers x 3, and sauce box x 2.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61BGjCCe6sL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kenuket","source_asin":"B0BDDNXZP5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-537587","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BDDNXZP5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BDDNXZP5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
