window.products.push({"id":537860,"name":"Tortilla warmers / server TWO SIDED – Double print Protected and Microwaveable –Keeps food warm up to one hour Perfect for picnics parties Corn , vege","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71o0zn4RMBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The tortilla warmer is a perfect item for your kitchen if you are a food lover and love tortillas or steamed food. You can steam different kinds of food including Naan, Tortillas, Bread, Waffles and Pancakes, Broccoli, Corn, Carrots, Yams, Potatoes and Beans etc.This warmer is perfect for parties and picnics as it can keep the food warm for a good amount of time (one hour). It is also a perfect kitchen item to gift to your loved ones. MICROWAVE INSTRUCTIONS: Take the tortillas out of the package and separate them if they're stuck together. Place them inside the tortilla warmer (Up To 9-12 Tortillas, More If they are Smaller)Microwave Tortilla Warmer for 50 seconds or until desired temperature is reached.Remove Tortilla Warmer from Microwave; Tortillas are now ready to serve; will stay moist and warm for one hour. CARE INSTRUCTIONS: Only For Microwave Use Not for Conventional OvenDon’t Use For Oily or Fried FoodsDon’t Microwave more than the recommended timeAir dry or hang dry, Don’t use electric Dryer INNOVATIVE COOKING UTILITIE: The Fabric Tortilla Warmer was once seen of only as a Mexican fast-food pouch, but it is now widely used in the United States and Latin America. It's a must-have handcrafted time-saver for every kitchen cook, allowing you to keep food fresh and warm for up to one hour.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71o0zn4RMBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B09FJWWM9G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-537860","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09FJWWM9G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09FJWWM9G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":537861,"name":"Biedermann Sons M1806 Multi-Color Jeweled Snuffer","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51nHvEHHsbL._AC_SL1379_.jpg","description":"More than 800 years ago the village of Schwaebisch Gmuend was founded by the Kings of Staufen who were responsible for settling this region known for its artisans specializing in the production of gold silver and brass jewelry as well as decorative ornaments. These works of art were shipped to markets in Italy and Western Europe. The tradition in metal arts survives today in this medieval walled town located near Stuttgart Germany. For generations families have engaged in ornament cutting designing their own unique decorations to give friends and relatives as gifts during the holiday season. The Biedermanns originated the creation of a single Christmas ornament commemorating each year drawing on the talent from this region. In the fall of 1970 we contacted several artisan families who among them designed and cut the first ornament which depicted the town square of Schwaebisch Gmuend. Since that first edition each year a group of artists has selected a single design from those submitted by the townspeople and the ornament to be cut for the coming season is chosen. This is now a tradition that the people of Schwaebisch Gmuend and America cherish. Designs through the years have been selected from those created by school children and adults. Our Master Cutter Georg Neumaier directs the production of the Biedermann Commemorative Ornament and is also involved in selecting the year`s winning design. The now very valuable original brass ornament was supplemented in 1984 by our first edition silver-plated ornament. Beginning in 1987 alternate years depict the story of The Twelve Days of Christmas. Nineteen ninety-eight began the first edition of the Christmas Quotations Series of ornaments. We take pride in offering the Biedermann Commemorative Ornaments to you the collector and to all connoisseurs of tasteful high quality craftsmanship. Multi-Color Jeweled Snuffer Size: 1.75 x 12 inches Box of 4","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51nHvEHHsbL._AC_SL1379_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Biedermann & Sons","source_asin":"B002VLNNZU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-537861","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B002VLNNZU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B002VLNNZU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
